PICO OpenXR Loader License Summary
=================================

This package includes files derived from the Khronos OpenXR SDK projects and
PICO-authored modifications and extensions.

Upstream origin
---------------
- https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK
- https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK-Source

Upstream license
----------------
Khronos-derived files in this package indicate the following SPDX license
expression in their file headers:

Apache-2.0 OR MIT

Copies of the applicable upstream license texts are provided at:
- ../Licenses/OpenXR-SDK.txt
- ../Licenses/OpenXR-SDK-MIT.txt

PICO modifications
------------------
PICO distributes modifications and extensions together with this package,
including PICO-specific OpenXR extension declarations and the
libopenxr_loader_pico.so binary.

See NOTICE.txt for provenance and redistribution details.
